# Route: guide 44 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 45 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Azshara, Desolace, Silverpine Forest, Alterac Mountains, Hillsbrad
# Foothills): Shadowsong Shrine -> Valormok -> The Shattered Strand ->
# Southridge Beach -> Temple of Arkkoran -> Thalassian Base Camp -> Temple of
# Arkkoran -> Southridge Beach -> Valormok -> The Ruined Reaches -> Kolkar
# Village -> Kodo Graveyard -> Magram Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Name of the Beast (3510;
# Hetaera 55); Khan Hratha (1380; Khan Hratha 42); Nothing But The Truth
# (1383; Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40); Shadowshard
# Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42,
# Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Assault on Fenris Isle (442; Thule Ravenclaw 24);
# The Crown of Will (520; Mug'thol 43).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blood of the Black Dragon Champion (6602), Vyletongue
# Corruption (7029), Legends of Maraudon (7044), Corruption of Earth and Seed
# (7064), The Pariah's Instructions (7067), Arugal Must Die (1014), Arugal
# Must Die (1014), Into The Scarlet Monastery (1048), Deathstalkers in
# Shadowfang (1098), Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (1098), The Power to
# Destroy... (5725), The New Plague (95216), Heart of Disruption (96984),
# Source of Power (96988), Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave Knight
# (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987), The Grave Knight (96986).

